  set:  # b913
    fields:  # b913
      root_cause: "py.py _extract_import_edges looks an import up in module_to_file_id by its dotted name only (import X -> .get(X); from X import Y -> .get(X.Y) or .get(X)); the map is keyed on repo-root / src-layout dotted names (tests.conftest, scripts.util) and nothing falls back to the importing file's own directory, so a bare same-directory import becomes an ExternalRef. Calls through the module already resolve in-tree; only the import edge is affected (read and reproduced 2026-10-29)."  # b913
